"Goose" <jeff_guss@yahoo.com> writes:

> So, in your opinions, is it worth the 4100 zorks to buy protection once
> as a  LV10 char?    I am playing a priest and he still has naked 10AC,
> but at this point I have -11AC from my armor already.

Umm.. what 4100? The price for buying protection is 400 * explevel, which
is 4000 for a level 10 char. Sounds like you have been paying more than
you need to..

Anyway, when you have worse than +1 naked Ac, it is ALWAYS a good idea to
buy protection whenever you can, and collect the money and come back to
the priest to do it.

When you have reached +1 naked Ac, it's worthwhile to try buying some more
if you happen to have enough gold when meeting a priest. But I usually
don't bother to collect and carry the gold because you mostly don't get
any more and at that point there's not much other use for the (heavy)
gold. YMMV.

