> ONE), other than Minetown and I've been to Sokoban so far...     is
> that uncommon?     I *always* found at least one shop in levels 1-5

Not uncommon, it is very much possible. Anyway, if you ask me, protection
from priests is always better use for gold than shops.

> Anyway... nowhere to spend my dough so I figured maybe blow it on a
> couple AC points?  If I get it, that is....

You *always* get it when you donate a proper amount of gold (at least 400
but less than 600 times your explevel) to a peaceful priest and don't have
better than +1 naked Ac yet.

